id to hide a dark  secret  behind her innocent facade last but not  least in addition to the three teens  there's also a new guidance counselor  coming to the hawkins high school namely  miss kelly  this role is played by hawaiian regina  ting chen  serious star david harbour was also  surprisingly talkative on the talk show  jimmy kimmel life  there he expressed his regret for the  fact that the production and the current  status are being kept from the fans so  that they don't find out anything before  the official start  however he did count to that by sharing  a few details  based on his statement filming is still  in progress and we can expect it to come  to a close around  august in the event of delays new  episodes would be released at the end of  the year at the earliest  especially considering how complex the  post-production of the series is  colleagues finn wolford and gate  madarazzo share a similar opinion as the  former in particular already announced  in the past  that he doesn't expect season 4 to start  any earlier than 2022  in any case we are excited to see  whether the rest of the shooting will  proceed as planned and we will of course  keep you  updated on the release date of stranger  things season 4.  on wednesday paramount pictures and  hasbro studios  finally announced the official title of  the upcoming 7th transformers movie in a  virtual conference  it will be called transformers rise of  the beasts and following the moderate  success of transformers  last night it'll breathe new life into  the franchise  meanwhile it's been three years since  the spin of bumblebee was released which  was well received but failed to generate  above average profits  all the more pleasing that producer  lorenzo de bueno ventura and director  stephen cabell jr have revealed a few  more details about the seventh part  which will be out next year  what is known is that the maximals  terracons and predacons fractions will  appear alongside the autobots and  decepticons  the former can transform not only into  vehicles but even into animal forms and  thus give the protagonist  a much harder time fans can expect  appearances by optimus prime mirage  rhinox eraser optimus primal as well as  the two female representatives archie  and nightbird  the story is set to be set in 1994  primarily in new york city and brooklyn  nearly 13 years after the storyline of  bumblebee  coincidentally the spin of starring  hayley steinfeld is also the predecessor  of rise of the beasts in terms of  content  the main villain is the terracon's  leader scorers who together with his  companions poses the greatest threat to  optimus and the team  we look forward to more information on  transformers rise of the beasts  and eagerly await its release in almost  exactly one year on june 24th  2022 we've known for a while that the  upcoming the flash  won't just have one or two superheroes  of its leaf in addition to the returning  barry allen alias the flash and the two  batman ben affleck and michael keaton  many fans are looking forward to the  newcomer sasha cali who will be  appearing as supergirl for the first  time  in keeping with his director andy  musgetty posted their first photo of the  superheroine's outfit on instagram some  days ago  you don't have to be a dc expert to  notice the color parallels to henry  cavill suit not only that but the  s-shaped symbol  on the chest which of course has nothing  to do with the actual ladder has only  been  marginally altered all of this could  indicate that their family relationship  of being cousins  is now thematized in the film and not  just in the comics  a further sign of this is the empty  cryogenic path that superman finds in  man of steel  and in which supergirl ought to be  however this is contradicted by the fact  that dc and warner have actually  concluded with the zack snyder movies  like for example man of steel  and do not want to continue them  thematically as you can see there are  still some unanswered questions  regarding the upcoming dc multiverse  spectacle  which unfortunately won't be clarified  anytime soon  the flash is expected to be released in  theaters on november 4th  2022 as  has been known for a few days a sequel  to 2020 scoop is set to be produced  with box office takings of just 26.3  million the proceeding film did not even  reach its budget of 90 million though  that was mainly due to the pandemic and  the fact that most movie theaters were  closed  the third film with the scooby-doo and  his pals nevertheless managed to bring a  refreshing  3d animated film to cinemas and home  theaters almost 16 years after  scooby-doo ii monsters unleashed despite  the fact that many die hard fans were  bothered about the many new elements  yet a further contributing factor is the  hanna-barbera multiverse that was  introduced in the film which  with its abundance of characters whether  the appetite for further sequels or  spin-offs  this is probably why warner took the  bold step of sticking with a franchise  in spite of red figures and supplying  fans with new content  according to director tony savoni who  was interviewed by comicbookmovie.com  the crew of the first part is back and  working on a sequel to scoop  however at the same time he pointed out  that it has not yet been officially  announced by warner  regarding the release date stevonnie  didn't want to or couldn't reveal  anything yet but considering the  circumstances  we expect warner to make an announcement  soon  last year disney announced several new  star wars projects at its big investor  day  among those is the anime series star  wars visions  about which for a long time nothing new  had been reported  fortunately that has now changed as  lucasfilm officially announced that the  anthology  is going to be presented during a 30  minute panel at the digital anime expo  light  besides a sneak preview you can of  course look forward to a various special  guests commenting on and following star  wars visions at the beginning of july  among them are executive producers james  road jackie lopez and josh rhymes who  will at least virtually join  anime producer kanako shirasaki and  co-producer justin leech  content-wise information is still scarce  so far all we really know is that the  project will consist of several short  films we'll definitely keep you posted  on the panel and look forward to  revealing more about star wars visions  very soon  we can even expect a release this year  on disney plus  soon the hotel transylvania series will  come to an end as the fourth and final  part is slowly approaching  although as a few days ago this is no  longer quite accurate since the  responsible parties officially reported  that the movie will not be released at  the end of july  but rather in october in regards to  content you can be prepared for a crazy  farewell with the main characters  dracula  jonathan frankenstein and wayne still  having an exciting adventure ahead of  them  due to the monstrification ray dracula  and the rest turn to humans whereas  johnny turns into a monster the former  monsters don't seem to like the new  human state that much which is why they  search all over the world to find a cure  whether they manage to return to their  old strength or whether dracula must  continue to live on as an  ordinary mortal is something you will be  able to find out in theaters  starting october 1st 2021  disney's live action film campaign  continues as deadline report last  wednesday an actress has finally been  found for the snow wildlife action film  adaption  we're talking about rachel zagler who's  about to make the leap from newcomer to  hollywood great  not only did the 20 year old play the  lead character in steven spielberg's  west side story but she also snacked a  role in the upcoming shazam  fury of the gods in addition to her  acting talent her singing voice must  also have been a reason for the  commitment as the multi-talented actress  has been wowing fans of her youtube  channel for  years with cover versions of well-known  songs the soundtrack is supposed to be  the main emphasis of the live-action  film anyway  just like the original from 1937 benji  passage and justin paul who already said  the right tone in la la land have been  entrusted with the music  expectations for snow white have  therefore been raised considerably and  we can most probably look forward to a  release as early as 2022  [Music]

